      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "I AM THE STORM (8) came from this row and worked but was too good in scoring by 2.8m at Melton last start, his fifth success from his last six starts. Should enjoy a nice trail so can strike again. SEATHESTARS (3) hasn't raced since March but was readied with a couple of trials and looked good in easily winning the latest. Draws nicely and races well at this distance. The recent form of ITS CONFIDENTIAL (4) has tapered off but he won the 3CG final of this series last season so is capable when right. OLLIES THE BOSS (10) may need some luck from this draw but has been racing well and deserved the last-start Melton win to follow a string of placings.",
